<title>USA: UNIVERSITY OF COLORADO, WON BY MERRILL LYNCH.</title>
<headline>UNIVERSITY OF COLORADO, WON BY MERRILL LYNCH.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Merril Lynch &amp; Co. said it won $12.760 million of University of Colorado, enterprise system refunding and improvement revenue bonds, Series 1997, with a true interest cost of 4.66 percent.</p>
</text>
